7
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:13,160
You are far from everyone you have ever

8
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:15,600
known.

9
00:00:13,160 --> 00:00:17,200
She walks into your class on a Monday.

10
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:18,280
She sits in the back row and says

11
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:21,240
little.

12
00:00:18,280 --> 00:00:22,280
You are 27 years old. You make almost no

13
00:00:21,240 --> 00:00:24,680
